      "title": "Duration — Latency (P50 / P95 / P99)",
      "description": "API Gateway request duration percentiles",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum(rate(api_gateway_request_duration_seconds_bucket{traffic_source!~\"synthetic_.*\"}[5m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "P50",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(api_gateway_request_duration_seconds_bucket{traffic_source!~\"synthetic_.*\"}[5m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "P95",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum(rate(api_gateway_request_duration_seconds_bucket{traffic_source!~\"synthetic_.*\"}[5m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "P99",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "PBFA97CFB590B2093"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "fixedColor": "red",
            "mode": "fixed"
          },
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.01
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.05
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 1
      },
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Errors — Error Rate (Infra)",
      "description": "Tỷ lệ lỗi hạ tầng (HTTP 5xx). Đã áp dụng Traffic Guard.",
      "type": "stat",
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "(sum(rate(api_gateway_requests_total{status=\"error\"}[5m])) / (sum(rate(api_gateway_requests_total[5m])) or vector(1))) and (sum(rate(api_gateway_requests_total[5m])) > 0.1)",
          "legendFormat": "Error Rate (Infra)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "PBFA97CFB590B2093"
      },
      "description": "🛡️ TRAFFIC GUARD STATUS — Chỉ số quan trọng để tránh Phantom Alert!\n\n• RPS > 0.1 (xanh): Traffic guard INACTIVE → Error Rate panels hiển thị bình thường\n• RPS = 0 (đỏ): Traffic guard ACTIVE → Error Rate panels = 'No Data' (đúng thiết kế)\n\n💡 SRE Insight: Nếu RPS = 0 mà vẫn thấy Error Rate > 0% → BẠN ĐANG BỊ PHANTOM ALERT!",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.1
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "reqps",
          "mappings": [
            {
              "options": {
                "from": 0,
                "to": 0.1,
                "result": {
                  "text": "🛡️ GUARD ACTIVE"
                }
              },
              "type": "range"
            },
            {
              "options": {
                "from": 0.1,
                "to": 999,
                "result": {
                  "text": "✅ TRAFFIC OK"
                }
              },
              "type": "range"
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9
      },
