      "description": "🔴 Processing failures = consumed − sent − skipped.\n\nExcludes intentional skips:\n• no_template: event types without notification mapping (e.g., stock.depleted)\n• duplicate: idempotency-filtered re-deliveries\n\nIf this panel shows > 0, there is a REAL processing error — not a benign event type mismatch.\n\n'No data' = zero errors (healthy).",
